{"i": "For {proj}, '{goal}' adds document sharing among users. Decompose authorization as a model before any route code.",
 "a": "Model-first decomposition: define the capability lattice per role and per resource relationship, decide allowlist versus blocklist defaults, choose where policy evaluation lives centrally, then implement routes consulting that policy with per-class adversarial probes. Authorization bugs are object-level misses, never route-level typos. The model exists before the decorators or the decorators invent it badly."},
