{"i": "For {proj}, '{goal}' spans persistence to pixels with {constraint} in the middle. Decompose fullstack with verification topology, not layer topology.",
 "a": "Decompose verification-wise: clause-to-witness mapping with witnesses positioned per layer the clause crosses, contract artifacts at each seam, per-seam integration checks, and end-flow acceptance verifying clause classes against the complete system, with {constraint} translated into its own seam rules. Layer topologies plan structure; verification topologies plan truth. The fullstack plan is a witness wiring diagram."},
